Examples / Beispiele. In the TeX-Shell:

  CD TeX:examples
  pdflatex hello.tex
  pdflatex paper.tex     then: bibtex paper, makeindex paper,
                         pdflatex paper.tex (twice)
  pdflatex tikz.tex
  pdflatex thesis.tex    then: bibtex thesis, pdflatex thesis.tex (twice)
  pdflatex slides.tex
  lualatex unicode.tex
  lualatex languages.tex (needs TeX-Fonts-Europe.lha, 256 MB)
  lualatex arabic.tex    (needs TeX-Fonts-Arabic-Hebrew.lha)
  lualatex hindi.tex     (needs TeX-Fonts-Asia-Africa.lha)
  lualatex chinese.tex   (needs TeX-Fonts-CJK.lha, 256 MB)

The first use of a font in lualatex takes a while (it builds a cache).
Der erste Gebrauch einer Schrift in lualatex dauert etwas (Zwischenspeicher).
